---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Price Drop Radar">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 prose prose-slate">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-8">Effective Date: August 23, 2026</p>

    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      At Price Drop Radar, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy outlines what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      We do not require account creation or personal data to browse deals. We collect non-personal analytics (such as browser type, referring URLs, and pages viewed) to measure site performance and optimize user experience. If you voluntarily submit your email for price alerts, we store it solely to deliver requested notifications.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Cookies and Affiliate Tracking</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      When you click an outbound link to Amazon.com, Amazon places a temporary tracking cookie on your browser to credit affiliate commissions. This cookie does not collect personally identifiable information and expires automatically according to Amazon's operating policies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Our website contains links to external merchant websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of third-party platforms.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-500">
      Contact: privacy@pricedropradar.com • Maloney Marketing
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
